  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b0d445ec-e782-4eaa-8c7d-71ce8ab0badd.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>歡迎來到跑酷方塊 ✨</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>這是一張精心設計的跑酷地圖，專為渴望兼具樂趣與挑戰的普通玩家打造！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>遊戲內容：</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>∎ 起點平台（下方暗藏秘密）🤫</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349550/description_935bcb92-a094-4a70-9d66-6ff746a02005.png\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349550/description_5b9398d8-e117-4519-aa2a-ec284613cdc4.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>∎ 重生點壓力板 👌</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349550/description_96303855-b2af-4f67-979b-19b80b4aae21.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>∎ 跨維度跑酷 🌏</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349550/description_0d0f095f-bc9d-41c9-a05c-63edbaf974ee.png\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349550/description_d3217ddc-ebf7-467f-b5f4-4d169d005cab.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>∎ 終點等待著驚喜 👀</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349550/description_b84e1c2c-498a-44eb-b912-5c797673afa6.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>👉 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/parkour-blocks/download/8261578\" rel=\"nofollow\">立即下載</a>並開始跳躍吧！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
